<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <%= image_tag '1-phwoar-thumb.jpg', height: 192 %>
    <%= image_tag '2-superb-thumb.jpg', height: 192 %>
    <%= image_tag '3-supremacy-thumb.jpg', height: 192 %>
    <%= image_tag '4-praetorian-thumb.jpg', height: 192 %>

    <h1>Welcome aboard, <%= @user.name %></h1>

    <p>Thanks for joining my reader's group!</p>

    <p>As promised, <%= link_to "here's your free book.", download_landing_index_url(token: Tokens::Generator.execute) %></p>

    <p>By the way, this email service isn't some soulless automaton, blindly squirting off emails upon the proper reader-magnet-y stimulus. Well. Not quite. I mean at face value it totally is, but (1) I'd coded every line of mikeyclarke.co.nz myself so it's still basically me doing it, and (2) I happily reply to, or, time allowing, certainly read, every reply emailed back to this address. Go ooon. Do reply if you'd like to.</p>

    <%= link_to "Click here to unsubscribe", mailkick_unsubscribe_url(@user, "list") %>

  </body>
</html>
